<title>UK: Kingfisher up ahead of trading statement.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher up ahead of trading statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kingfisher climbed to a five-week high on Tuesday amid expectations the UK retailer would issue an upbeat trading statement on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1031 GMT, the shares were up 11p to 659.  </p>
<p>&quot;Kingfisher has been a good market against the trend of the sector. (The trading statement) is expected to show they did well during Christmas,&quot; said one market maker.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
